== run 1
python 3.11.17 linux
== SQLite 3.45.1
1. two first joins
  A (alpha) read active_agent_id=None; B (beta) read None
  A's add_participant(alpha): ok
  after A returns: agents listed: ['alpha', 'beta'] | stored active_agent_id: 'alpha' | get_active_agent: 'alpha'
  B's add_participant(beta): ok
  after B returns: agents listed: ['alpha', 'beta'] | stored active_agent_id: 'beta' | get_active_agent: 'beta'
2. explicit selection during a first join
  A (alpha) read active_agent_id=None
  B: add_participant(beta), then set_active_agent(beta) -> active_agent_id='beta'
  after B's explicit selection: agents listed: ['alpha', 'beta'] | stored active_agent_id: 'beta' | get_active_agent: 'beta'
  A's add_participant(alpha): ok
  after A returns: agents listed: ['alpha', 'beta'] | stored active_agent_id: 'alpha' | get_active_agent: 'alpha'
3. leave during a first join
  A (alpha) read active_agent_id=None
  B: remove_participant(alpha) -> True
  after B's leave: agents listed: [] | stored active_agent_id: None | get_active_agent: None
  A's add_participant(alpha): RuntimeError: Failed to upsert participant agent:alpha
  after A returns: agents listed: [] | stored active_agent_id: 'alpha' | get_active_agent: 'alpha'
  set_active_agent(alpha) now: ValueError: Agent 'alpha' is not an active participant
4. two first joins, no pause
  200 rooms: both joins read no active agent and wrote one in 0; in 0 of those the stored active agent is not the first agent listed; errors: 0
